node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo

# dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored here, unlike the MCP server repos in this
# project. Those publish to npm, so the registry carries their build output.
# This one is GitHub-only, and the built bundle IS the deliverable - the file
# the site copies into its assets. Ignoring it would leave the thing this repo
# exists to produce obtainable only by cloning and building it.
